{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"音楽プレーヤーの整理をしてるんだけど\n途中から動かない..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どうしたものか。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/08/09/1284396/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"琴子"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"画質悪くてごめんね(´・ω・`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"隣に座ってたから撮ったんだけど\n暗かった(;_;)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さて、\nのぎ天アップされてまーす！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『＃5　のぎ天クイズ！inパリ!!（後半戦）』\nパリの豪華賞品を手にするのは乃木坂頭脳王・中田か!? はたまた乃木坂頭NO王コンビの和田＆畠中が番狂わせを起こすのか!?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"http://video.rakuten.co.jp/content/110972/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そういえば\nこの司会やってくださってる早出さん！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂はよくお世話になってるんだけど\n昨日、アメトーークに出てらっしゃった(*°-°*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『アニカンRヤンヤン!!』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日発売でした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すこーしだけですが\n中田も載せていただいてるので\n探して見てね！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/08/09/1284396/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「「答えちゃうお( °_ゝ°)ノ」」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/08/09/1284396/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もうこれからの夏は全ツのみ！！\n頑張る～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/08/09/1284396/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/08/09/1284396/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かなメルでも言ったけど\n家に一旦帰ろうと思ってたら\n帰れなくなったため\n着れませんでした(´-ι_-｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/08/09/1284396/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そうー！\nおいシャンの方はわかりやすかっただろうけど\nよくお気づきで！！\nありがとう～＼^^／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"以上！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"10thシングルの個別\n今日始まってました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1次もう締め切っちゃった＞＜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"告知できなくてごめんね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"地方1部減ってしまいまして\nすぐに3部に戻ってしまいました＞＜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"フルでできるようになりたいです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もっとメディアに出れるように頑張ります"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}